  "system": {
    "identifier": "path-of-the-genius",
    "description": "<p>You adjust your Taijutsu stance to embody the fighting style of a prodigy. Someone whose skills and technique comes along once in a generation to usher in a new form of fighting. While you are in a Taijutsu stance you can achieve the following;</p>\n<p><strong>Elite Taijutsu.</strong> Once per turn, a Taijutsu you cast gain the Elite keyword. Taijutsu with the Elite keyword gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls.</p>\n<p><strong>The New Era.</strong> Increase the Taijutsu save DC of Taijutsu you cast that forces a creature to make a saving throw, by +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Next Generation.</strong> Beginning at 9th level, Taijutsu you cast with the Elite keyword that forces a creature to make a Chakra control check to maintain concentration, can instead force the target to make an Athletics check.</p>",
